c2b4aQct9RvJ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"88297","synopsis":"静歌の「彼氏候補」になった涼は早速静歌をデートに誘い、遊園地に行くことに。しかし、自分に自信が持てない静歌は、涼の好意を素直に受け止められない。涼は浮かない顔の静歌と観覧車に乗り込んで…？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hmVAgeljgIw6QIUGfvjKI2NFRjG.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"静歌の「彼氏候補」になった涼は早速静歌をデートに誘い、遊園地に行くことに。しかし、自分に自信が持てない静歌は、涼の好意を素直に受け止められない。涼は浮かない顔の静歌と観覧車に乗り込んで…？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hmVAgeljgIw6QIUGfvjKI2NFRjG.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"330086","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"88300","synopsis":"雨宿りのために観覧車に乗った二人は、冷えた体をいたわり合う。くっついて温まりながら、静歌に優しく気持ちを伝える涼。まっすぐな言葉に思わずドキドキしていると、涼が「キスしていい？」と聞いてきて…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l12Th1qZUfcx72BCBio9uaGzSPR.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"雨宿りのために観覧車に乗った二人は、冷えた体をいたわり合う。くっついて温まりながら、静歌に優しく気持ちを伝える涼。まっすぐな言葉に思わずドキドキしていると、涼が「キスしていい？」と聞いてきて…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l12Th1qZUfcx72BCBio9uaGzSPR.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13192","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"72520","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers